reqInvest":"FALSE","strongEarly":"FALSE","Cube Reqs":"Cube Reqs","cubes":"Vigor Cube,Resilience Cube","cubeNotes":"Vigor For better tanking, Resilience for more taunt uptime if needed.","Skill Prios":"Skill Prios","SkillPrioPvp":"FALSE","SkillPrioBudget":"1/1/1","SkillPrioReq":"5/5/4","SkillPrioOrder":"S2 = S1","SkillPrioImportance":"Mid","SkillPrioNotes":"Skill 1 can offer tremendous damage reduction depending on game mode, or not much at all. Level 5 should normally be enough for Interception and Solo raid purposes. Very slight DPS improvement.\n\nSkill 2 simply increases her “health pool” and punishment she can take.\n\nBurst Simply increases her damage reduction and slightly increases her sustain, however sufficient investments in her skill 1 and 2 should be enough for her to get through most bosses without needing to invest much in her burst.","Overload Prios":"Overload Prios","OPEleDmgDealt":"","OPHitRate":"","OPMaxAmmo":"","OPATK":"","OPChDMG":"","OPChSpeed":"","OPCRate":"","OPCDMG":"","OPDFEF":"","OPPrio":"","OPNotes":"","roles":"Tank","summary":"Featured Damage sponge of the game. Great in PvP","id":43},"tierlist2":{"name":"Moran (Treasure)","Tier List":"Tier List","Combined":"SSS","Story":"SSS","Boss":"SSS","PvP":"SSS","Wishlist":"","isNew":"FALSE","reqHands":"FALSE","reqInvest":"FALSE","strongEarly":"FALSE","Cube Reqs":"Cube Reqs","cubes":"Tempering Cube, Vigor Cube","cubeNotes":"She doesn't have any need for ammo management thanks to her Burst, and Cubes that reduce her damage taken help make her downright unkillable. \nIn Electric-weak Solo Raid settings, she should use the highest level cube to boost her Electric DPS against them, as it is quite significant thanks to S1","Skill Prios":"Skill Prios","SkillPrioPvp":"TRUE","SkillPrioBudget":"4/7/4","SkillPrioReq":"7/10/10","SkillPrioOrder":"S2 > S1","SkillPrioImportance":"Highest","SkillPrioNotes":"Skill 1 still works the same as before, providing her with DPS with Burst Active and increasing DEF as her HP decreases. As soon as Treasure is made, she is given a -20 cooldown reduction on her Burst for PvE only, making her very usable for PvE. Recommended to level to 10 if using her to deal DPS vs Electric-weak.\n\nSkill 2 still has her max HP heal when dropping below 20% max HP and her Taunt when firing last bullet, but now it includes a cooldown reduction for the team that scales up with levels, making it very important to level.\n\nBurst now comes with a caster ATK buff, alongside the weapon DPS going up, and boosting her life leech, further boosting her survivability. ","Overload Prios":"Overload Prios","OPEleDmgDealt":"","OPHitRate":"","OPMaxAmmo":"","OPATK":"","OPChDMG":"","OPChSpeed":"","OPCRate":"","OPCDMG":"","OPDFEF":"","OPPrio":"","OPNotes":"","roles":"Taunter, Survival, Buffer","summary":null,"id":195},"recommendations":{"_id":"6a58f7c40cf4995042b0d36f","name":"Moran","main":"Vigor Cube","alternative":"Resilience Cube","notes":"Vigor For better tanking, Resilience for more taunt uptime if needed.","id":60},"overloadrecs":null,"dollskills":[{"id":2281151,"name":"Bring It On!","description":"■ Activates at the start of battle. Affects self.\n<color=#00AEFF>DEF ▲ {description_value_01}% continuously for every 1% of HP lost.</color>\n■ Activates when landing {description_value_03} normal attack(s) while weapon is changed. Affects the target.\n<color=#00AEFF>Deals {description_value_02}% of <word_group=10025>final</word_group> ATK as additional damage.</color>\n■ Activates when Raptures appear. Affects self.\n<color=#00AEFF>Fervor: <word_group=10031>Cooldown</word_group> of Burst Skill ▼ {description_value_04} sec continuously.</color>","icon":"icn_skill_defup_01","cooldown":"","levels":[{"description_value_01":"1.93","description_value_02":"25.95","description_value_03":"5","description_value_04":"20"},{"description_value_01":"2.1","description_value_02":"28.31","description_value_03":"5","description_value_04":"20"},{"description_value_01":"2.28","description_